git clone<url>
Used only once when you don’t have the project.
What it does:
Downloads entire repository
Creates a new folder
Gets all branches + history
Sets remote (origin) automatically.


git fetch<url>
Check for updates safely
What it does:
Downloads latest changes from remote
❗ Does NOT change your files
Updates only Git’s internal data

git pull (Update your code)
What it does:
Fetches changes AND
Merges them into your current branch


